# Exact parachute-core source used by Cloud's shared @openparachute/core engine
# file dependency (workers/vault -> file:../../../parachute-core/packages/vault/core).
# CI and local deploys verify this commit so unrelated upstream work or a
# developer branch cannot change a build or deployment (cloud#45, cloud#59).
#
# The engine moved from parachute-vault (core/) into parachute-core
# (packages/vault/core/) with its history, via git subtree at vault 42fbf93
# (vault 0.7.9), which contains vault 1a66150 (#762). The previous pin, vault
# f147e34 (vault#785, T-36), was one commit on 1a66150; core#23 carries it over.
# Pinned at parachute-core main 86cbddd: a9c9024 (the T-36 fix production ran
# from vault#785, and T-318's import fix) plus the T-318 day review's engine
# fixes: path_prefix / exclude_path_prefix / rename-tag without LIKE under the
# Durable Object 50-byte LIKE cap (#27), one json_each param for a tag query
# over 100+ child tags under the 100-param cap (#28), a rename's cascade writes
# fire `updated` (#29), and restoring a snapshot the old exporter wrote keeps
# flow-looking metadata exact (#32). #30/#31 are CLI/hub only. The
# door-contract tree is untouched.
# Now pinned at parachute-core main 638c04a (#35, T-318 #8): a portable-md export
# that copies a note's attachment writes that note's `](/api/storage/<path>)`
# links to it as the relative path to `.parachute/attachments/<id>/<basename>`
# and records it as the ref's `body_link`; import turns back exactly those, so
# the body round-trips. The binaries are now written before their note, so in
# the /api/export tar an attachment entry precedes its note. Also between
# 86cbddd and here: 0.8.0-pre.2 (#33; in the engine only test fixture and
# comment wording) and docs (#34). packages/vault/src history-import and the
# CLI/hub changes are outside the engine Cloud builds.
#
# The SHA is the entire pin. The engine package (packages/vault/core) is still
# 0.1.0 and never moves; PARACHUTE_CORE_VERSION is the workspace root version,
# checked so the pin's release line is legible, not as protection.
PARACHUTE_CORE_REPO_URL="https://github.com/ParachuteComputer/parachute-core.git"
PARACHUTE_CORE_REF="638c04ad17caf4f1d9b4440b1a3eacf91e45c066"
PARACHUTE_CORE_VERSION="0.8.0-pre.2"
CORE_ENGINE_DIR="packages/vault/core"
CORE_ENGINE_VERSION="0.1.0"
